#!/usr/bin/env python3
# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""nezzxBET: one-file Python web app and Telegram bot. Python 3.11+.

Render Web Service, Python runtime:
    Build Command: python -m py_compile bot.py
    Start Command: python bot.py
    Health Check: /health

Environment:
    BOT_TOKEN=your Telegram bot token (TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN is also accepted)
    ADMIN_ID=your numeric Telegram user ID (comma-separated IDs are accepted)
    ADMIN_TOKEN=a random admin-panel password, at least 24 characters
    SITE_URL=https://your-service.onrender.com
    DATA_DIR=/var/data        # attach a Render persistent disk here
    APP_ENV=production
    BOT_MODE=webhook          # polling is also supported
    HOUSE_EDGE_BPS=600
    TRADE_RECEIVER=CANYAPON

No pip packages, Node.js, public folder or separate image files are required.
HTML, CSS, JavaScript, catalog and images are embedded at the end of this file.
Only runtime data and optional backups are written to DATA_DIR.

Commands:
    python bot.py --self-test
    python bot.py --verify round.json
    python bot.py --backup backup.sqlite
    python bot.py --export-static ./public

Player commands: /start /balance /profile /id /inventory /bonus /support /help
Owner commands: /admin /stats /requests /addbalance ID AMOUNT [reason]
Use site:123 for a site ID, tg:123456789 for a Telegram ID.
Game-item trades are performed manually and confirmed by an administrator.
The default 6% mathematical edge does not guarantee profit in each round.
Free bonuses, referrals and admin grants are separate promotional expenses.
"""
